            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 3.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.12.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.9.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 9.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.3.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 3.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ci dwan ocako winnye ma a ki i polo kun wacci, “In aye i Woda ma amaro, ma cwinya yom i komi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cutcut Cwiny Maleŋ otero Yecu woko wa i tim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci obedo i tim nino pyeraŋwen; Catan ocako bite, ma onoŋo en tye kacel ki lee tim, kun lumalaika gikonye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ma gitweyo Jon woko i mabuc, Yecu ocako bino i Galilaya kun tito lok me kwena maber ma a ki bot Lubaŋa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.3.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 3.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " owacci, “Kare doŋ oromo, ker pa Lubaŋa onyiko cok; wuŋut, wuye lok me kwena maber.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Yecu onono woto rabo dog nam me Galilaya, ci oneno Cimon ki ominne Anderiya, ka gitye ka bolo obwo recgi i nam; pien gin lumak-rec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yecu ocako lwoŋogi ni, “Wubin wulub kora, ci an abimiyowu wudoko lumak dano.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci cutcut gutugi weko obwogi, gulubo kore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok guwoto anyim manok, ci oneno Yakobo ki ominne Jon, gin awobe pa Jebedayo, ma onoŋo gitye i yeya ka lubo obwo recgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En otugi lwoŋogi cut, ci giweko wongi Jebedayo odoŋ ki luticce i yeya, gucako lubo kore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
